# Mobile-first responsive

**Authority for layout responsiveness.** CWV/PSI tactics → `09-technical-seo-mobile.mdc`. Tokens → `06-tailwind.mdc`.

## Principle

Style the **smallest screen first**, then enhance with `sm:` / `md:` / `lg:` (min-width). Never design desktop-first and hide with `max-*` overrides unless matching an existing LCP exception.

| Prefix | Min width | Typical use |
|--------|-----------|-------------|
| (base) | 0 | Phone — default layout |
| `sm:` | 640px | Large phone / small tablet |
| `md:` | 768px | Tablet / hero image may appear |
| `lg:` | 1024px | Desktop nav (`lg:flex`), wider grids |
| `xl:` | 1280px | Rare — only if content truly needs it |

## Layout patterns (use `TW_*`)

| Need | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Section shell | `TW_CONTAINER` + `TW_SECTION_PY` |
| Card listing | `TW_CARD_GRID` → `1` / `sm:2` / `lg:3` |
| Two-up form/features | `TW_GRID_2` → `1` / `sm:2` |
| Prose | `TW_CONTAINER_NARROW` (+ `lg:px-8` when needed) |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — desktop-first
<div className="grid grid-cols-3 max-md:grid-cols-1">

// ✅ GOOD — mobile-first (or TW_CARD_GRID)
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
```

## Hard constraints

- **No horizontal scroll** at 375px / 390px — wrap long Urdu titles; avoid fixed widths wider than viewport
- Gutters via `TW_CONTAINER*` (`px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`) — do not invent one-off padding scales
- Images: explicit `sizes` reflecting real columns (`100vw` → `50vw` → `33vw` as breakpoints grow)
- `viewport` in root layout: `device-width`, `initialScale: 1`, `viewportFit: 'cover'` — keep aligned
- Safe areas: drawers/sticky chrome use `env(safe-area-inset-*)` (see `TW_MOBILE_PANEL*`)
- **Content parity:** same primary content on mobile and desktop. `hidden md:block` only for decorative / LCP hero image exceptions (`09`)

## Typography scale

- Base readable size on phone; bump at `sm:`/`md:` only when hierarchy needs it
- Nastaliq leading/tracking still → `03-rtl-urdu.mdc` (never shrink leading below 1.9 for body)

## Verify

Check 375 · 768 · 1440. Skills: `tailwind-ui` · `rtl-check` · CWV → `optimize-lcp` / `09`.
